    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100212" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπ-ερείδω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>help in driving against</i>, c. acc. rei, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.939b
			</span></i>; <i>help in inflicting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληγήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Brut.</u>
					52
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὑπόνοιάν τινι</span>
			<i>help to fix</i> a suspicion on him, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cic.</u>
				21
			</span></i> (cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συναπ-</span>); <i>drive
				home</i> a weapon, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phil.</u>
				10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπερείσας τῇ ῥύμῃ τοῦ
				ἵππου</span>
			<i>charging</i> him with all the force of his horse, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; <i>give additional force</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				12.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, = Lat. <i>conitor</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dosith.
				p.433
			</span></i> K., <u>Gloss.</u>
        </div>
